   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "d_p0",
    "kind": "problem",
    "color": "6",
    "md": "# Data preprocessing: a shape search can use, per source\n**Sub-problem of** semantic search **step 12** (the \"sub-problem\" arrow): the same goal, finding the right document for semantic questions, approached from the data side (16 Nov).\n\n**Why:** the 41 semantic questions we still fail (brainstorm 006) fail in two ways:\n- near-twin documents from one template, told apart only by details (customer, numbers, dates);\n- the answer is a side detail of a document about something else.\n\nToday every document is cleaned and cut into chunks the same way, whatever its source. Each source has its own structure (tickets, threads, emails, transcripts), and we could use it.\n\nOne step per source, starting with Linear."
   }
  },
