    "map": "card",
    "id": "d_s1",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 1 · Linear: tickets with a description (16 Nov)\n**Why first:** worst failure rate. 6 of its 10 semantic questions fail (60%).\n- 35,308 tickets, 6.9% of the corpus; 58 of the 500 questions expect one.\n- ✓ The parser finds a **description in 99.96%** (13 tickets are free text).\n- Other fields: acceptance criteria 75%, comments 76%, plus ~20 optional sections (notes 25%, rollout plan 23%, tasks 16%, next steps 2%…).\n- Description: median 782 chars, about **18% of the ticket** (ticket median 5,041; p90 4,457 vs 7,011)."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "text-d_s1-0",
   "type": "text",
