   "text": "Why first: worst failure rate. 6 of its 10 semantic\nquestions fail (60%).\n• 35,308 tickets, 6.9% of the corpus; 58 of the 500\n  questions expect one.\n• ✓ The parser finds a description in 99.96% (13\n  tickets are free text).\n• Other fields: acceptance criteria 75%, comments\n  76%, plus ~20 optional sections (notes 25%,\n  rollout plan 23%, tasks 16%, next steps 2%…).\n• Description: median 782 chars, about 18% of the\n  ticket (ticket median 5,041; p90 4,457 vs 7,011).",
