   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "d_s1a",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "### Where the answers are (58 Linear questions)\nThe ticket section sharing the most words with the gold answer (a rough heuristic):\n- description: 25 (43%)\n- acceptance criteria: 12\n- other sections (notes, rollout plan, decisions…): 15\n- comments: 6\nSemantic questions only: description 3, acceptance criteria 4, other 3.\nSo the description says what the ticket is about, but holds the answer in fewer than half."
   }
  },
