   "text": "The ticket section sharing the most words with the\ngold answer (a rough heuristic):\n• description: 25 (43%)\n• acceptance criteria: 12\n• other sections (notes, rollout plan, decisions…):\n  15\n• comments: 6\nSemantic questions only: description 3, acceptance\ncriteria 4, other 3.\nSo the description says what the ticket is about, but\nholds the answer in fewer than half.",
   "originalText": "The ticket section sharing the most words with the\ngold answer (a rough heuristic):\n• description: 25 (43%)\n• acceptance criteria: 12\n• other sections (notes, rollout plan, decisions…):\n  15\n• comments: 6\nSemantic questions only: description 3, acceptance\ncriteria 4, other 3.\nSo the description says what the ticket is about, but\nholds the answer in fewer than half.",
