    "id": "d_next1b",
    "kind": "open",
    "color": "3",
    "md": "### ? Next (free, local)\n- Embed the 35k descriptions only (fine-tuned gte, minutes) and search them with the 58 Linear questions: where does the right ticket rank, against today's chunk search?\n- The 6 failing semantic Linear questions (0187, 0214, 0218, 0240, 0275, 0285): does a description search find the ticket?\n- The agent's side: top-k descriptions with titles, then a \"read ticket\" tool. Measure tokens per question against 5 full documents."
