    "map": "card",
    "id": "d_next2a",
    "kind": "open",
    "color": "3",
    "md": "### ? Next\n- Of the 79 questions with a Slack right document, how many name or imply its channel? (local, by hand or with the review page)\n- Can an LLM guess the right channel from the question? (Gemini, paid: ask first)\n- Agent side: a channel argument on the search tool, and a list of the 35 channels in its prompt."
   }
