   "text": "• Of the 79 questions with a Slack right document,\n  how many name or imply its channel? (local, by\n  hand or with the review page)\n• Can an LLM guess the right channel from the\n  question? (Gemini, paid: ask first)\n• Agent side: a channel argument on the search\n  tool, and a list of the 35 channels in its prompt.",
