   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "n1",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 1 · Diagnose the misses\n**Why:** before fixing anything, find out what goes wrong.\n\n- ✗ **Text fixes.** 115k documents were stored as Python lists; we decoded them and rebuilt the keyword index. Recall stayed at 55.2%: not the cause.\n- **Second judge.** An LLM checks whether the document the answer came from really answers the question. Of 57 wrong answers, 10 are *ambiguous* questions (another document answers too). **46 are real search failures.**\n- **Exact ranks.** Where does the right document land among all 512k? Keyword search (BM25): median rank 446. Vector search (gte embeddings): median 2,334. Both far below the top 5 the LLM reads."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "text-n1-0",
