   "text": "• ✗ Text fixes. 115k documents were stored as\n  Python lists; we decoded them and rebuilt the\n  keyword index. Recall stayed at 55.2%: not the\n  cause.\n• Second judge. An LLM checks whether the\n  document the answer came from really answers\n  the question. Of 57 wrong answers, 10 are\n  ambiguous questions (another document answers\n  too). 46 are real search failures.\n• Exact ranks. Where does the right document land\n  among all 512k? Keyword search (BM25): median\n  rank 446. Vector search (gte embeddings): median\n  2,334. Both far below the top 5 the LLM reads.",
   "originalText": "• ✗ Text fixes. 115k documents were stored as\n  Python lists; we decoded them and rebuilt the\n  keyword index. Recall stayed at 55.2%: not the\n  cause.\n• Second judge. An LLM checks whether the\n  document the answer came from really answers\n  the question. Of 57 wrong answers, 10 are\n  ambiguous questions (another document answers\n  too). 46 are real search failures.\n• Exact ranks. Where does the right document land\n  among all 512k? Keyword search (BM25): median\n  rank 446. Vector search (gte embeddings): median\n  2,334. Both far below the top 5 the LLM reads.",
