    "map": "card",
    "id": "n2",
    "kind": "decision",
    "color": "4",
    "md": "### ✓ Decision\nThe problem is **finding** the right document, not ranking it.\n\nThe corpus is full of near-duplicates: e.g. five documents about the same GPU deal that differ only in \"8 GPUs vs 48\" or \"1-year vs 3-year term\". Search returns the look-alikes instead."
   }
  },
  {
