    "kind": "open",
    "color": "3",
    "md": "### ? Before the full pass (avoid a second one)\n- Define the schema from the review notes (Slack page) and the failure patterns (brainstorm 006).\n- Measure vLLM speed on 1,000 documents (~$0.10).\n- Pilot on ~10k documents (~$0.50), check the output on the failing questions.\n- One 512k pass; **store the raw model output**, so new fields are re-parsed, not re-mined.\nA second pass costs only ~$15–25, but 1–2 days of GPU plus a re-index."
   }
  },
