    "md": "### ✓ Decision (20 Nov): train the SLM\nMined fields earn their cost: field search + agent lift the Slack dev top 5 from 39.0% to 55.5%, and the answer holds the right case in 96.4% of the ambiguity set. Next: [[Train the Slack field extractor SLM]], then [[Update the pipeline with the accepted experiments]] and the final evaluation."
