    "map": "card",
    "id": "n3",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 2 · Embedding fixes\n**Why:** maybe the vectors are too coarse (one vector per 24,000 characters averages the detail away).\n\n**Test setup (\"candidates\"):** for each of the 46 failed questions, take vector search's own top 50 plus the right document (~51 candidates), and see where the right one ranks among them.\n\n- ✗ **Smaller chunks** (4k / 2k / 1k characters): right document in top 10 in 0–1 of 46.\n- **Another model** (jina-v3, 1k chunks): 9 of 46. Better, but partly because the candidates were picked by gte; also non-commercial licence.\n- ✗ **Late chunking** (each chunk sees the whole document): worse in 27 of 46. It blurs the one detail that matters."
   }
  },
