    "card": "n3"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "text-n3-3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 20.0,
   "y": 1347.5,
   "width": 435.36,
   "height": 200.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "g-n3"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1551623881,
   "version": 22,
   "versionNonce": 735622534,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795607209624,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• ✗ Smaller chunks (4k / 2k / 1k characters): right\n  document in top 10 in 0–1 of 46.\n• Another model (jina-v3, 1k chunks): 9 of 46.\n  Better, but partly because the candidates were\n  picked by gte; also non-commercial licence.\n• ✗ Late chunking (each chunk sees the whole\n  document): worse in 27 of 46. It blurs the one\n  detail that matters.",
   "originalText": "• ✗ Smaller chunks (4k / 2k / 1k characters): right\n  document in top 10 in 0–1 of 46.\n• Another model (jina-v3, 1k chunks): 9 of 46.\n  Better, but partly because the candidates were\n  picked by gte; also non-commercial licence.\n• ✗ Late chunking (each chunk sees the whole\n  document): worse in 27 of 46. It blurs the one\n  detail that matters.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
