   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "n5",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 3 · Reranker\n**Why:** the reranker (a cross-encoder that reads question + document together) is our most precise scorer, but it only sees the top 50 candidates.\n\n- If the right document were among its candidates, it would put it in the **top 5 in 29 of 46** cases.\n- But each document costs ≈ 65 ms to rerank (50 docs ≈ 3.2 s per question). A shorter 2k-character input is 4.6× faster but loses ~7 points of recall."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "text-n5-0",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 20.0,
   "y": 1815.0,
   "width": 143.05,
