   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "n7",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 4 · Agents\n**Why:** let an LLM search several times with its own queries instead of one fixed search.\n\n- **Snippet agent:** keyword results come back as short snippets, with a tool to read a full document. Semantic: 52.8% → **60.8%** (cost $7.17 for 125 questions).\n- **Keyword agent + Gemini caching:** caching the conversation start saves money, not time.\n- On **completeness** questions (need several documents): 55% → **70%**.\n\nHelps, but costs per question and still misses the hidden near-duplicates."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "text-n7-0",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 20.0,
   "y": 2265.0,
   "width": 117.08,
   "height": 32.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "g-n7"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
