   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "n8",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 5 · Fact extraction\n**Idea:** the near-duplicates differ in *details* (amounts, people, dates, ids). Extract those details from every document into short facts and index them, so search can match on them.\n\nAt 512k documents an API LLM is too expensive, so: label a sample with a big LLM, then teach a **small local model** to do the same."
   }
  },
