    "map": "card",
    "id": "n9",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 5a · Labels and model\n- ✓ **Labels from DeepSeek V4.1 Flash** (Chinese API, ~25× cheaper than Gemini, terms allow training on its outputs): per document an \"about\" line, up to 20 entities and 12 short facts, as JSON. 3,000 training docs + 2,370 test docs, ≈ $7.\n- ✓ **Small model: Qwen3.5-2B**, fine-tuned with **LoRA** (trains a small add-on, 0.75% of the weights) on a rented RTX 4090: 68 min, **$1.01**.\n- Result: valid JSON on 100% of held-out documents; wording close to DeepSeek's."
   }
  },
  {
