   "updated": 1795607209627,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• ✓ Labels from DeepSeek V4.1 Flash (Chinese\n  API, ~25× cheaper than Gemini, terms allow\n  training on its outputs): per document an \"about\"\n  line, up to 20 entities and 12 short facts, as JSON.\n  3,000 training docs + 2,370 test docs, ≈ $7.\n• ✓ Small model: Qwen3.5-2B, fine-tuned with\n  LoRA (trains a small add-on, 0.75% of the\n  weights) on a rented RTX 4090: 68 min, $1.01.\n• Result: valid JSON on 100% of held-out\n  documents; wording close to DeepSeek's.",
   "originalText": "• ✓ Labels from DeepSeek V4.1 Flash (Chinese\n  API, ~25× cheaper than Gemini, terms allow\n  training on its outputs): per document an \"about\"\n  line, up to 20 entities and 12 short facts, as JSON.\n  3,000 training docs + 2,370 test docs, ≈ $7.\n• ✓ Small model: Qwen3.5-2B, fine-tuned with\n  LoRA (trains a small add-on, 0.75% of the\n  weights) on a rented RTX 4090: 68 min, $1.01.\n• Result: valid JSON on 100% of held-out\n  documents; wording close to DeepSeek's.",
   "fontSize": 20,
