    "map": "card",
    "id": "n10",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 5b · Quality check (LLM judge)\n**Why:** facts that are wrong would send search to the wrong document.\n\nGemini reads the document and checks every extracted fact: supported / not stated / contradicted.\n- **DeepSeek labels: 0.9%** of facts wrong, none invented — slips like the wrong person or a merged clause.\n- **Our fine-tuned model: 2.6%** wrong (3× more), worst on long meeting transcripts (7%).\n- Facts keep 50% of what benchmark answers need — they're short by design."
   }
  },
