    "kind": "decision",
    "color": "4",
    "md": "### ✓ Decisions (8 Nov)\n- DeepSeek labels pass: good enough to train on.\n- Facts are for **search only**; the answer is still read from the full document, so 50% coverage is fine.\n- No 10k label set (API credit nearly used up)."
   }
