    "map": "card",
    "id": "n13",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 5c · Retrieval pilot\n**Why:** do the facts actually help search? Same candidates as step 2 (46 failed questions), using DeepSeek's facts.\n\n- ✗ **All facts as one vector per document:** right doc in top 10 in 1 of 46. Averaging 12 facts blurs the key one.\n- **One vector per fact:** 12–14 of 46 (gte or MiniLM), better than text vectors… ✗ but never improves on keyword search, at any weight.\n- **Keyword search (BM25) over the facts**, added to today's search: **2 → 20 of 46** in the top 10."
   }
  },
  {
