    "map": "card",
    "id": "n14",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 5d · Cost\nVector indexes must sit in RAM, so size = server bill.\n\n- **BM25 facts field:** +0.5 GB, **≈ $0** extra.\n- **One vector per fact:** 6.7M vectors, +15–50 GB → **+$175–500 per month** on managed Postgres (today ≈ $175–210)."
   }
  },
