    "id": "n16",
    "kind": "open",
    "color": "3",
    "md": "### ? Next (not done: step 5 stopped)\n- **Full-index test:** add the facts field to the real index and run all questions. The candidates favour anything that isn't gte, so check we don't lose questions that work today.\n- **Cheap alternatives:** give the reranker the facts instead of a long chunk; embed facts only for the top candidates at query time; tiny binary vectors (≈ 0.65 GB)."
   }
