   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "legend",
    "kind": "note",
    "color": null,
    "md": "**How to read**\n🟪 **One map, all problems**, side by side left to right; a labelled \"sub-problem\" arrow links a problem to the step it grew out of.\n⬇ **Down = progress**: the steps in the order we did them.\n➡ **Right = depth**: what a step found, the decision on it, and where the route ends.\n\n**Legend**\n🟪 problem · 🟦 step\n🟩 decision / conclusion\n🟨 open\n\n**Where a route ends**\n🟥 ⛔ **Dead end**: tried, nothing left to explore\n🟧 ⏸ **Stopped**: could work, but not worth the cost (for now)\n\n✓ chosen · ✗ didn't work\n\n**Route groups**\n🟨 ▶ **In progress**: being worked on\n🟥 ⏸ **Not exploring** (dashed border): stopped or rejected\n🟩 ✓ **Accepted**: worked, in use"
   }
  },
