   "text": "🟪 One map, all problems, side\nby side left to right; a labelled\n\"sub-problem\" arrow links a\nproblem to the step it grew out\nof.\n⬇ Down = progress: the steps\nin the order we did them.\n➡ Right = depth: what a step\nfound, the decision on it, and\nwhere the route ends.",
