    "map": "card",
    "id": "end5d",
    "kind": "stopped",
    "color": "2",
    "md": "### ⏸ Stopped: one vector per fact\n6.7M extra vectors, +15–50 GB, **+$175–500 per month**, and it never beat keyword search over the same facts. Not worth the gigabytes or the time (9 Nov).\n\n**Reopen if** a full test shows a gain BM25 can't get."
   }
  },
