   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "end5",
    "kind": "stopped",
    "color": "2",
    "md": "### ⏸ Stopped: LLM summaries / facts per document (9 Nov)\n- **Not enough gain:** even on the small pilot (the candidates of 46 failed questions), the summaries didn't help search enough to justify the work.\n- **Doesn't scale:** the corpus keeps growing. Every new document needs a summary, and we can't keep guaranteeing the accuracy of the old ones as the model and data change.\n\nA structured taxonomy (step 6) makes this less likely, but doesn't rule it out.\n\n**Reopen if** buckets alone can't separate the near-duplicates."
   }
  },
