    "map": "card",
    "id": "m_gte",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "### gte-modernbert-base · embedder\nSemantic search. Alibaba, **149M** params.\n- **768-dim** vectors; reads up to **8,192 tokens**.\n- We store chunks of ~24,000 characters, so ≈ 1 vector per document (512k vectors).\n- ✗ Can't tell near-duplicates apart."
   }
  },
