    "map": "card",
    "id": "m_rr",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "### gte-reranker-modernbert-base · reranker\nCross-encoder: reads question + document together. **149M** params.\n- Reads **8,192 tokens** (question + document), so it sees whole documents.\n- ≈ **65 ms per document** → 50 candidates ≈ 3.2 s per question.\n- ✓ Top 5 in 29 of 46 failures *if* the right document is among its candidates."
   }
  },
