    "id": "m_bm25",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "### BM25 (bm25s) · keyword search\nNo model: exact word matches, rare words weigh more.\n- ✓ Best single signal on the failures' candidates (top 10 in 31 of 46).\n- ✗ Misses paraphrases (\"step down\" vs \"annealing\")."
   }
  },
