    "id": "m_qwen",
    "kind": "decision",
    "color": "4",
    "md": "### Qwen3.5-2B + LoRA · our small model\nFine-tuned fact extractor (LoRA r16, 3 epochs).\n- Native context **262k tokens**; trained at **4,096** (longer documents cut).\n- ≈ **12 s per document** on the laptop GPU (RTX 2000 Ada, 8 GB).\n- Training: 68 min, **$1.01** on a rented RTX 4090.\n- Valid JSON 100%; **2.6%** of facts wrong."
   }
  },
