    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 7 · Evaluation improvement\n**Idea:** Currently evaluation assumes that we one-shot the relevant document, but in real life we can make agent ask follow up questions. The main idea is to add evaluation on the same questions, but allow agent to ask about the details and have details prepared."
   }
  },
