    "id": "s6a",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 6a · How deep must the reranker read?\nToday's search over all 512k documents, but kept 1,000 deep instead of 50. Failures where the right document is in the list:\n- 50 (today): **8** of 46\n- 100: 14 · 300: **22** · 1,000: **30**\n\n✗ 16 failures never show up, even at 1,000."
