    "map": "card",
    "id": "s6b",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 6b · Reranker on the candidates\nRight document among its ~51 candidates, 46 questions. Recall@5 = found in the top 5.\n- ✓ **Reranker on full text:** recall@5 **54%** (25 found, 21 missed), recall@10 72%. 59 ms per document.\n- ✓ **Reranker on facts only:** recall@5 **54%** (25 / 21), recall@10 61%. **11 ms** per document, 5× faster.\n- ✗ **+ BM25 facts:** recall@5 54–59%, fewer at rank 1. Adds little once the reranker runs.\n- BM25 text alone: recall@5 43%."
   }
  },
