   "text": "Right document among its ~51 candidates, 46\nquestions. Recall@5 = found in the top 5.\n• ✓ Reranker on full text: recall@5 54% (25 found,\n  21 missed), recall@10 72%. 59 ms per document.\n• ✓ Reranker on facts only: recall@5 54% (25 / 21),\n  recall@10 61%. 11 ms per document, 5× faster.\n• ✗ + BM25 facts: recall@5 54–59%, fewer at rank\n  1. Adds little once the reranker runs.\n• BM25 text alone: recall@5 43%.",
   "originalText": "Right document among its ~51 candidates, 46\nquestions. Recall@5 = found in the top 5.\n• ✓ Reranker on full text: recall@5 54% (25 found,\n  21 missed), recall@10 72%. 59 ms per document.\n• ✓ Reranker on facts only: recall@5 54% (25 / 21),\n  recall@10 61%. 11 ms per document, 5× faster.\n• ✗ + BM25 facts: recall@5 54–59%, fewer at rank\n  1. Adds little once the reranker runs.\n• BM25 text alone: recall@5 43%.",
