    "map": "card",
    "id": "s6c",
    "kind": "decision",
    "color": "4",
    "md": "### ✓ Conclusions (9 Nov)\n- The bottleneck is **getting into the list**, not ranking inside it.\n- BM25 over facts doesn't add to the reranker.\n- Facts make deep reranking affordable: 300 fact blocks ≈ 3.3 s per question, about today's cost for 50 full documents.\n- Rough estimate: **52.8% → about 61–62%** semantic (not measured)."
   }
  },
