   "text": "• The bottleneck is getting into the list, not ranking\n  inside it.\n• BM25 over facts doesn't add to the reranker.\n• Facts make deep reranking affordable: 300 fact\n  blocks ≈ 3.3 s per question, about today's cost for\n  50 full documents.\n• Rough estimate: 52.8% → about 61–62%\n  semantic (not measured).",
   "originalText": "• The bottleneck is getting into the list, not ranking\n  inside it.\n• BM25 over facts doesn't add to the reranker.\n• Facts make deep reranking affordable: 300 fact\n  blocks ≈ 3.3 s per question, about today's cost for\n  50 full documents.\n• Rough estimate: 52.8% → about 61–62%\n  semantic (not measured).",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
