   "updated": 1795607209639,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "s6d",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 6c · End-to-end test (9 Nov)\n**Why:** check the 61–62% estimate with real search instead of the candidates.\nToday's hybrid search, 300 deep, then the reranker over all 300. Only 20% of these documents have facts; the rest use their first 2k characters. 46 failures:\n- In the fused 300: **20** (at 50: 7).\n- ✓ **Full text @300:** recall@5 **20%** (9), recall@10 22%. **~20 s** per question.\n- ✗ **Facts / 2k @300:** recall@5 11% (5), recall@10 20%. ~4.7 s.\n- ✗ Full text @50 (today's depth): recall@5 4% (2), ~3.8 s.\n- ✗ Text + facts (RRF): recall@5 17%.\n- In the list but not top 5: rank 6–139, median 24. A deeper list holds more near-duplicates.\n- None of today's top-5 hits lost. Passing questions not tested.\n→ semantic at most **52.8% → 60.0%** (full text), 56.8% (facts). Estimate was too optimistic."
   }
  },
