    "map": "card",
    "id": "s6b_llm",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 6b′ · LLM reranker on fact blocks (idea)\n**Idea:** instead of gte-reranker, give an LLM (Gemini 3.8 Flash) the question and all fact blocks and let it return the top 10.\n\n- Fact blocks are short: **~438 tokens** per document vs ~1,500 full text → **~23k tokens** per question for ~53 candidates (~80k full text).\n- ✗ **LLM price:** ~**$0.019** per question on facts ($2.3 per 125 questions, ~$19 per 1,000); full text ~$0.061; 300 fact blocks ~$0.10.\n- ✓ **Dedicated GPU (L4, ~$580/month):** ~$0.00007 per question at full load, **~250× cheaper**; break-even with the LLM at ~1k questions/day. Serverless GPU ~$0.00008 per question.\n- The reranker already runs on a GPU today, so on facts it costs nothing extra; the LLM is a new cost, slower (est. 2–5 s vs 0.3–0.6 s) and its quality is untested.\n(GPU prices approximate, not checked; LLM quality not measured.)"
   }
  },
