   "originalText": "• Fact blocks are short: ~438 tokens per document\n  vs ~1,500 full text → ~23k tokens per question for\n  ~53 candidates (~80k full text).\n• ✗ LLM price: ~$0.019 per question on facts ($2.3\n  per 125 questions, ~$19 per 1,000); full text\n  ~$0.061; 300 fact blocks ~$0.10.\n• ✓ Dedicated GPU (L4, ~$580/month): ~$0.00007\n  per question at full load, ~250× cheaper;\n  break-even with the LLM at ~1k questions/day.\n  Serverless GPU ~$0.00008 per question.\n• The reranker already runs on a GPU today, so on\n  facts it costs nothing extra; the LLM is a new cost,\n  slower (est. 2–5 s vs 0.3–0.6 s) and its quality is\n  untested.\n(GPU prices approximate, not checked; LLM quality\nnot measured.)",
