   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "end6b_llm",
    "kind": "stopped",
    "color": "2",
    "md": "### ⏸ Stopped: LLM reranker not financially viable (9 Nov)\nAn LLM reranker adds ~$0.019 per question on top of a GPU we already pay for, ~250× the GPU's cost per question, with no measured quality gain. It also needs facts for every document (step 5 stopped).\n\n**Reopen if** a test on the 46 failures (~$0.90) shows an LLM ranks near-duplicates clearly better than gte-reranker (recall@5 54%), or LLM prices drop ~10×."
   }
  },
