    "map": "card",
    "id": "s6d_trunc",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 6d · Rerank on the first N tokens (9 Nov)\n**Why:** is the facts' 5× speed-up the extraction, or just shorter input? Cut each document to its first N tokens, no model.\nCandidates (recall@5 / @10, ms per doc):\n- full text 54% / 72%, 58.5 ms · facts 54% / 61%, 11.4 ms\n- ✗ first 256: 43% / 50%, 5.9 ms\n- first 512: 52% / 57%, 11.8 ms (≈ facts)\n- ✓ **first 1,024: 59% / 70%, 26 ms**\nEnd to end, 300 deep: first 1,024 = full text (recall@5 20%) at 27 vs 66 ms per doc."
   }
  },
