   "text": "Why: is the facts' 5× speed-up the extraction, or just\nshorter input? Cut each document to its first N\ntokens, no model.\nCandidates (recall@5 / @10, ms per doc):\n• full text 54% / 72%, 58.5 ms · facts 54% / 61%,\n  11.4 ms\n• ✗ first 256: 43% / 50%, 5.9 ms\n• first 512: 52% / 57%, 11.8 ms (≈ facts)\n• ✓ first 1,024: 59% / 70%, 26 ms\nEnd to end, 300 deep: first 1,024 = full text\n(recall@5 20%) at 27 vs 66 ms per doc.",
