    "id": "s6d_trunc_dec",
    "kind": "decision",
    "color": "4",
    "md": "### ✓ Decision (9 Nov)\nFor reranker speed, **cut to the first 1,024 tokens**: full-text quality at ~2.3× the speed (50 docs: ~3.1 s → ~1.3 s), no model, nothing goes stale. Facts are no longer needed for speed. Not switched on yet; use when latency is needed (agents, deeper lists)."
