    "map": "card",
    "id": "s8",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 8 · What does the embedder add? (10 Nov)\n**Why:** before training anything, measure what gte brings next to BM25.\n\nReplayed gte, BM25 and fused top 50 for all 500 questions (742 right documents):\n- both find it: **54%**\n- BM25 only: **24%**\n- ✗ gte only: **3%**\n- neither: **19%**\n\ngte mostly finds what BM25 already finds; it fails on semantic questions.\n`exploration/retriever_attribution/`"
   }
  },
