   "text": "Replayed gte, BM25 and fused top 50 for all 500\nquestions (742 right documents):\n• both find it: 54%\n• BM25 only: 24%\n• ✗ gte only: 3%\n• neither: 19%",
   "originalText": "Replayed gte, BM25 and fused top 50 for all 500\nquestions (742 right documents):\n• both find it: 54%\n• BM25 only: 24%\n• ✗ gte only: 3%\n• neither: 19%",
