    "id": "s8a",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 8a · Bigger general embedder: Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B\n**Why:** the usual advice is to try a stronger model before fine-tuning.\nSample estimate (100 questions, 163 right docs, 5k distractors; full re-index would take ~23 h):\n- gte: top 50 49%, with BM25 **128**\n- Qwen: top 50 55%, with BM25 **128**\n- ✗ semantic 9 vs 9 of 27: better only at keyword-like matches BM25 already has."
   }
  },
