    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 8b · Who can tell near-duplicates apart? (teacher)\n46 semantic failures, ~53 candidates each, right document in top 5:\n- gte: 0\n- ✓ **gte-reranker: 25** (median rank 4, local, free)\n- gemini-embedding-2: 17 (spreads near-duplicates 2.7× wider, but ranks worse than the reranker in 26 of 46)"
