    "id": "s9c",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 9c · Biggest drop per question\nLargest step between neighbouring reranker scores in the top 30; negatives = up to 5 just below it; skip the question if its source is below.\n- Benchmark failures: right doc above the drop 27 of 46.\n- ✓ Training-like sample: **91 of 100**, median 1 above the drop.\n- ✗ Knee detectors (Kneedle, TAA-k) and a small ML model: no better (46 examples too few to learn the line)."
   }
  },
