    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 10 · Our own training questions (11 Nov)\n**Why:** keep the benchmark for the final test only, and tune on a dev set so we don't overfit to it.\nBenchmark's own prompts (MIT), one-document types first, same type and source mix. No evaluation document or its 20 nearest neighbours as a source. Brainstorm 005."
