   "text": "Why: keep the benchmark for the final test only, and\ntune on a dev set so we don't overfit to it.\nBenchmark's own prompts (MIT), one-document\ntypes first, same type and source mix. No\nevaluation document or its 20 nearest neighbours\nas a source. Brainstorm 005.",
   "originalText": "Why: keep the benchmark for the final test only, and\ntune on a dev set so we don't overfit to it.\nBenchmark's own prompts (MIT), one-document\ntypes first, same type and source mix. No\nevaluation document or its 20 nearest neighbours\nas a source. Brainstorm 005.",
