    "map": "card",
    "id": "s10a",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 10a · Generation + mining\n- 3,120 sources, **3,011 valid** questions, **$0.96** (DeepSeek, LangGraph)\n- intra-document: 238 of 347 pass the benchmark's check\n- mining: search + rerank + biggest drop, local, ~3.2 h\n- ✓ kept **train 2,067 / 2,510**, **dev 422 / 501**, 5 negatives each\n- semantic skipped 35%; for 61% of semantic questions the source wasn't in the fused top 50, yet the reranker rescues most → exactly what the embedder must learn\n- review fix: no dev answer as a train negative (and the reverse)"
   }
  },
