   "text": "• 3,120 sources, 3,011 valid questions, $0.96\n  (DeepSeek, LangGraph)\n• intra-document: 238 of 347 pass the benchmark's\n  check\n• mining: search + rerank + biggest drop, local, ~3.2\n  h\n• ✓ kept train 2,067 / 2,510, dev 422 / 501, 5\n  negatives each\n• semantic skipped 35%; for 61% of semantic\n  questions the source wasn't in the fused top 50,\n  yet the reranker rescues most → exactly what the\n  embedder must learn\n• review fix: no dev answer as a train negative (and\n  the reverse)",
   "originalText": "• 3,120 sources, 3,011 valid questions, $0.96\n  (DeepSeek, LangGraph)\n• intra-document: 238 of 347 pass the benchmark's\n  check\n• mining: search + rerank + biggest drop, local, ~3.2\n  h\n• ✓ kept train 2,067 / 2,510, dev 422 / 501, 5\n  negatives each\n• semantic skipped 35%; for 61% of semantic\n  questions the source wasn't in the fused top 50,\n  yet the reranker rescues most → exactly what the\n  embedder must learn\n• review fix: no dev answer as a train negative (and\n  the reverse)",
