    "id": "s11",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 11 · Fine-tune gte with hard negatives (12 Nov)\n**Why:** teach the embedder our near-duplicates, the failure no general model fixed (step 8).\nFull fine-tune of gte-modernbert-base (149M) on 2,067 questions, 5 hard negatives each, cached MNRL, 32 questions per step. Rented RTX 4090 ($0.37/h).\nDev check: rank each dev question's right document among its own ~51 search candidates."
   }
