    "id": "s11a",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 11a · Runs (dev, 422 questions)\nTop 10 / MRR / semantic top 10:\n- before: 49% / 0.35 / 23%\n- ✗ laptop, docs cut to 1,024 tokens: 55% / 0.34 / 47% (top 1 drops)\n- full length, lr 2e-5: 73% / 0.50 / 68%\n- lr 1e-5: 78% / 0.56 / 69%\n- ✓ **lr 5e-6, 2 epochs: 82% / 0.56 / 77%**\n- lr 5e-6, 3 epochs: 82% / 0.57 / 72%\n- 64 per step: 78% / 0.58 / 67% (sharper top, fewer found)\nGentle training wins; full-length documents are essential."
   }
