    "id": "dec11",
    "kind": "decision",
    "color": "4",
    "md": "### ✓ Decision (12 Nov)\nUse **lr5e-6-e2**: best top 10 and semantic, tied MRR. The embedder's job is to get the right document into the reranker's list, so top 10 counts most.\nIts vectors go in separate `_768_ft` tables; retrievers `gte-ft-chunk`, `hybrid-ft`, `hybrid-ft-rerank`."
   }
  },
