    "id": "s11b",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 11b · Real search over the whole corpus (dev)\nCorpus re-embedded on 4 × RTX 4090 (512k chunks, 21 min, ~$2.30). 422 dev questions through production search, base vs fine-tuned:\n- embedder top 50: 61% → **70%** (semantic 35% → 53%)\n- fused top 50: 80% → **84%**\n- ✓ reranked top 10: 80% → **84%** (semantic 49% → **61%**)\n- first place: 70% → 74%\nSmaller than the candidate check: near-duplicates from the whole corpus compete now. The reranker places every listed right document (353/353)."
   }
  },
