    "id": "s11d",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 11d · Benchmark run (13 Nov)\n**Why:** dev questions are ours; the benchmark's 500 are the real test.\nRun 31, `hybrid-ft-rerank`, all 500 questions, **$4.53**, against the base runs 7, 17, 19–26. Correct answers:\n- ✓ overall 75.4% → **77.6%**\n- ✓ basic 86.3% → **90.9%**\n- ✗ semantic 52.8% → **54.4%** (+5 / −3 questions)\nDev had promised semantic 49% → 61% in the top 10."
   }
  },
