    "md": "## 12 · Where do the right documents get lost? (13 Nov)\n**Why:** find out why the fine-tuned gain doesn't reach the benchmark.\nReplayed base and fine-tuned search on the 125 semantic questions; where the right document lands at each stage (local, free). Base → fine-tuned:\n- gte alone, top 50: 38 → **59**\n- fused 50 (the reranker's list): 75 → 80\n- reranked top 5: 69 → 72\n- not in the reranker's list: 50 → 45\n`exploration/embedder_finetune/benchmark_semantic_check.py`"
   }
  },
