    "id": "con12",
    "kind": "decision",
    "color": "4",
    "md": "### ✓ Conclusion (13 Nov)\n- ✓ The embedder did learn: gte alone finds 21 more right documents.\n- ✗ BM25 already had most of them, so fusion adds only 5.\n- ✓ The reranker isn't the limit: it puts ~90% of the right documents it sees in the top 5.\n- Fusion keeps only 50 of ~100 candidates and cut 8 right documents the fine-tuned gte found (its ranks 35–48)."
   }
  },
