    "map": "card",
    "id": "s12a",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 12a · Rerank the union of both lists (15 Nov)\n**Idea:** each question gets gte top 50 + BM25 top 50, about 97 different documents (only ~3 shared), but fusion keeps 50. Rerank all of them instead. No new search; full text, nothing cut.\nRight document in the final 5, 125 semantic questions (fused 50 → union):\n- base gte: 69 → 73\n- ✓ fine-tuned gte: 72 → **80** (55.2% → **64.0%** against today's production)\n- fine-tuned: gained 10, lost 2; not among the candidates 45 → 31\n- ✗ rerank time per question: 3.3 s → 6.3 s\n`exploration/embedder_finetune/union_rerank_check.py`"
   }
  },
