    "map": "card",
    "id": "s12b",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 12b · HyDE and query rewriting (dev, 15 Nov)\n**Idea:** let Gemini write a passage that would answer the question (HyDE) and 4 rewritten search queries; search with them too. Fine-tuned gte, 118 semantic dev questions, top 5 (Gemini $0.21):\n- union, question only: 61.0% (97 docs, ~6 s)\n- ✓ + 4 rewrites as extra searches: **69.5%**, ✗ 392 docs, ~24 s rerank\n- + HyDE as extra searches: 65.3% (180 docs); adds nothing on top of rewrites\n- all 12 lists fused, RRF top 100: 67.8% (~6 s)\n- ✗ replacing the question: HyDE in gte 50.0%, a paraphrase 47.5% (the fine-tuned gte matches questions)\nAll 422 dev: union vs fused 50, top 5 82.2% → 83.9%, no type loses.\n`exploration/query_expansion/expansion_check.py`"
   }
  },
