    "map": "card",
    "id": "s12d",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 12d · Merged query on the benchmark (16 Nov)\n**Why:** dev questions are written like our training ones; check the merges on the benchmark's 125 semantic questions (Gemini $0.22). One gte + one BM25 search, ~95 docs. Top 5, test / dev:\n- question / question (union): 64.0% / 61.0%\n- ✓ **question / question + 4 rewrites appended: 67.2%** / 63.6% (+7 / −3 questions)\n- mean(question, HyDE) / question: 65.6% / 63.6%\n- mean(question, 4 rewrites) / question + rewrites: 65.6% / 65.3%\n- ✗ dev's best, mean(question, HyDE) / keyword rewrite: **60.8%** / 66.9%\n- ✗ question / keyword rewrite: 60.8% / 63.6%\nBM25 alone, right doc in its top 50 (test / dev): question 62.4% / 42.4%, keyword rewrite 52.0% / 49.2%, ✓ question + rewrites **72.0% / 59.3%**.\n`exploration/query_expansion/benchmark_merge_check.py`"
   }
