   "originalText": "Why: dev questions are written like our training\nones; check the merges on the benchmark's 125\nsemantic questions (Gemini $0.22). One gte + one\nBM25 search, ~95 docs. Top 5, test / dev:\n• question / question (union): 64.0% / 61.0%\n• ✓ question / question + 4 rewrites appended:\n  67.2% / 63.6% (+7 / −3 questions)\n• mean(question, HyDE) / question: 65.6% / 63.6%\n• mean(question, 4 rewrites) / question + rewrites:\n  65.6% / 65.3%\n• ✗ dev's best, mean(question, HyDE) / keyword\n  rewrite: 60.8% / 66.9%\n• ✗ question / keyword rewrite: 60.8% / 63.6%\nBM25 alone, right doc in its top 50 (test / dev):\nquestion 62.4% / 42.4%, keyword rewrite 52.0% /\n49.2%, ✓ question + rewrites 72.0% / 59.3%.\nexploration/query_expansion/benchmark_merge_\ncheck.py",
