    "map": "card",
    "id": "con12d",
    "kind": "decision",
    "color": "4",
    "md": "### ✓ Decision (16 Nov)\n- ✓ **Rewrites go to BM25 only, appended to the question; gte keeps the plain question.** It holds on dev and the benchmark.\n- ✗ HyDE and vector means dropped: the LLM doesn't know the answer or our documents, so its guesses add noise to the vector; wins there look like a lucky keyword.\n- BM25 needs only one right \"golden keyword\", and appending keeps the question's own words.\n- ✗ The gain is small: BM25 finds 10–17 points more right documents, but only 3–4 more questions reach the top 5. The reranker loses them among near-duplicates."
   }
  },
