    "id": "next12d",
    "kind": "open",
    "color": "3",
    "md": "### ? Next (brainstorm first)\n- Why does the reranker lose the extra right documents BM25 finds?\n- How many rewrites does BM25 need (keyword one only, or all 4)? Local, free.\n- 24 right documents are still in neither list.\n- Then a full paid benchmark run (~$5–6)."
