   "updated": 1795607209667,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• ✗ No inference: gender null for everyone, though\n  Ada is called \"daughter\".\n• ✗ Records mix people up: in extract_json,\n  Babbage and William King became Ada's parents,\n  Lord Byron got \"reformer\" (that's Anne Isabella).\n  The same parent_of as a relation was right.\n• ✗ Label names matter: alias always filled,\n  same_as never, with the same description.\n• ✗ A description field gives surface phrases, not\n  summaries.\n• ✗ Every field is optional: name can be null, so\n  records need validating (Pydantic).\n• Tasks in one call run in parallel: entities don't\n  constrain relations; relations can't restrict head/tail\n  types.",
   "originalText": "• ✗ No inference: gender null for everyone, though\n  Ada is called \"daughter\".\n• ✗ Records mix people up: in extract_json,\n  Babbage and William King became Ada's parents,\n  Lord Byron got \"reformer\" (that's Anne Isabella).\n  The same parent_of as a relation was right.\n• ✗ Label names matter: alias always filled,\n  same_as never, with the same description.\n• ✗ A description field gives surface phrases, not\n  summaries.\n• ✗ Every field is optional: name can be null, so\n  records need validating (Pydantic).\n• Tasks in one call run in parallel: entities don't\n  constrain relations; relations can't restrict head/tail\n  types.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
