   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• only for what the text states (customer, region,\n  dates, ids, people);\n• one value per field rather than records of many\n  linked fields; links as relations;\n• try 2–3 label names per field; validate every\n  record;\n• inferred attributes (industry, size, purpose) go to\n  classification, checked hardest on the ~200\n  reference labels;\n• long threads: split by message (the long-text\n  helper chunks at 384 tokens).",
   "originalText": "• only for what the text states (customer, region,\n  dates, ids, people);\n• one value per field rather than records of many\n  linked fields; links as relations;\n• try 2–3 label names per field; validate every\n  record;\n• inferred attributes (industry, size, purpose) go to\n  classification, checked hardest on the ~200\n  reference labels;\n• long threads: split by message (the long-text\n  helper chunks at 384 tokens).",
