    "map": "card",
    "id": "d_dec5b",
    "kind": "decision",
    "color": "4",
    "md": "### ✓ Decision (16 Nov): a fine-tuned SLM\n- Weighed: fine-tuned GLiNER (≈ $1, still spans), DeepSeek on all Slack (≈ $175 off-peak, $0.0006 a thread, and again per source), an SLM with LoRA (≈ $15–35).\n- **Chosen: the SLM.** It writes phrases and relations and runs cheaply on every source.\n- Reuse the fact-extraction setup (Qwen3.5-2B, `exploration/fact_extraction/train.py`, Vast.ai)."
   }
  },
