    "md": "### ? Next (updated 17 Nov)\n1. ✓ Tighten the DeepSeek prompt (strict tool call, frozen `fc8ae8878988`).\n2. ✓ Hand check on 13 threads and a 30-item smoke test.\n3. ✓ Labels: 25,632 items, reused as training data (step 6).\n4. LoRA the SLM; score it with `score.py` on the held-out 200."
