    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 6 · Field test: do mined fields find the right thread? (17 Nov)\n**Why:** before training the SLM, check that the fields help search at all. DeepSeek stands in for the SLM: it is the quality ceiling.\n- Set: the 200 Slack semantic dev questions; baseline top 5 **39.0%** (three lists pooled, reranked).\n- The right thread never reaches the reranker for **95 of 200**."
   }
  },
