    "md": "## 6a · Labelling run (17 Nov)\n**Why:** fields for every candidate of the 200 questions, the right threads, 1,000 random threads and 1,200 questions; also SLM training data (half A of the questions).\n- ✓ 25,632 of 25,633 items, **$26.54**, one frozen prompt.\n- ✗ Strict mode doesn't enforce enums: off-list areas and labels are repaired in code (568 first failures).\n- Schema: 26 fields, `area` (19 business areas), `concept`, `doc_date`."
