    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 6b · Fields as a re-ordering signal (17 Nov)\n**Idea:** reranker score + field match (names, topic, problem, area), weights picked on half A.\n- ✗ Held-out half B: top 5 43 → 45, top 1 31 → 30: noise.\n- ✗ Names matched by embedding: no gain.\n- ✗ Any weight ≥ 0.25 hurts: the cross-encoder already sees what the fields say."
