    "md": "## 6c · Fields as a search: one shot, then an agent (17 Nov)\n**Idea:** search the 24,432 labelled documents by their fields instead of raw text. Right thread in the first 50, missed / reached questions:\n- Today's gte: 1% / 58%.\n- ✓ One-shot field search: 47% / 84%.\n- Agent v1 (one line per result): 39% / 71%.\n- Agent v2 (+ snippets, picks): 35% / 73%.\n- ✓ **Agent v3 (+ documented areas and profiles): 53% / 86%**; top 10 34% / 70%. $0.38 for 200."
