    "md": "### ✓ Conclusion (17 Nov)\n- ✓ The fields work as a **search**, not as a re-ranker.\n- ✓ The agent only works once its tools are **documented**: what each area holds, how filters match, when to use each profile. Area filter use 11% → 99%.\n- Caveat: a 24k labelled pool, not the full corpus."
