    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 6e · Asking the person + source and channel filters (17 Nov)\n**Idea:** the 9 Nov clarification setup (memory notes, 25% with a wrong detail, Gemini plays the person), `ask_user` up to 2 times.\n- ✗ v3 + asking: no gain; replies (\"a chat thread in the release channel\") had no filter to go to.\n- ✓ v4 adds `sources` and `channels` filters: on the 85 questions where it asked, top 10 27% → 39%.\n- ✗ Wrong-detail notes barely gain: a wrong channel hides the thread.\n- Run-to-run noise: 6–10 points at top 10."
   }
  },
