    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 6f · How ambiguous are the questions? (17 Nov)\n**Why:** some \"misses\" may be other threads that answer too. Gemini rates each shown document alone (method of `question_ambiguity`), 1,498 ratings.\n- ✓ The right thread answers its question: full 189 / partial 10 / none 1.\n- ✗ **76.5%** of questions: another shown document answers fully, with *different* facts (near-twins).\n- Final top 5 holds an answering document 84.5% (today) / 88.0% (agent), the right thread 39.0% / 55.5%."
   }
  },
