    "md": "## 8b · Classifier input: snippet or text?\n**Idea:** Gemini sees the question and the shown documents and says same answer / one case fits / several cases fit (ask). Baseline prompt, ask precision / recall:\n- ✗ 300-char snippet (what the agent sees): 0.89 / 0.59, misses 12 of 29 asks\n- ✓ first 3,000 chars: 0.85 / 0.76 (F1 0.80)\n- 12,000 chars: 0.82 / 0.79, no better"
