    "map": "card",
    "id": "d_s8c",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 8c · Prompt calibration\nAsk F1 on 3,000 chars:\n- baseline 0.80 / 0.81 (two runs)\n- ✗ v2 (rules for details, iterations) 0.77\n- ✗ v3 (each document's case listed first) 0.80 / 0.72\n- ✗ v4 (each document judged on its own) 0.76\n- Same prompt flips 3–6 decisions between runs (±0.05 F1): no prompt beats the baseline.\n- Wrong or mixed answers: 1–3 of 83 in every run; most missed asks still answer from the right thread (the question was written from it).\n- ~$0.5 a run."
   }
  },
