    "md": "### ✓ Decision (20 Nov)\n- Keep the baseline prompt.\n- The agent does the check itself on its final top 5 in full, from the cache, then asks or answers.\n- The agent runs on Gemini Flash (agent_llm.py; DeepSeek before). Check ≈ $0.005, whole pipeline ≈ $0.02 a question (docs/solution_plan.md)."
   }
