    "map": "card",
    "id": "d_s8d",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 8d · Answer: main case + similar cases, cited\n**Why:** the classifier can't always tell which case the person means, so the answer must hold the right one anyway.\n- Rule: answer from the best-fitting document, mention the other similar ones briefly (their case, how they differ).\n- Citations: [n] after every fact, turned into [doc_id] in code, so the app opens the document on click.\n- Gemini answers, a second call checks where the right answer is."
   }
  },
