    "md": "### ✓ Result (20 Nov): right answer in 96.4% of responses\n- As main answer 84.3%, only as a mentioned case 12.0% (ambiguous: 27.6%)\n- Right thread cited inline 97.6%; 612 of 623 fact lines cited (rest are headings)\n- Mentions other cases in 90% of answers, often 5 at full length\n- $0.85 a run"
