   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "dg_n19",
    "kind": "decision",
    "color": "4",
    "md": "### ✓ Decision (9 Nov)\nDon't use TnT-LLM as is. Keep its pattern, replace the expensive steps:\n- **Cluster** the gte vectors first (free); the LLM only **names ~2,000 clusters** from ~10 titles each (≈ 4M tokens, ≈ $3).\n- **Titles** instead of LLM summaries (summaries stopped, see step 5 of the semantic search failures map).\n- Taxonomy from a **small sample**; a small model or vector similarity assigns the rest (TopicGPT: open models assign well, but create taxonomies poorly)."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "text-dg_n19-0",
   "type": "text",
