   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795607209684,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Don't use TnT-LLM as is. Keep its pattern, replace\nthe expensive steps:\n• Cluster the gte vectors first (free); the LLM only\n  names ~2,000 clusters from ~10 titles each (≈ 4M\n  tokens, ≈ $3).\n• Titles instead of LLM summaries (summaries\n  stopped, see step 5 of the semantic search\n  failures map).\n• Taxonomy from a small sample; a small model or\n  vector similarity assigns the rest (TopicGPT: open\n  models assign well, but create taxonomies poorly).",
   "originalText": "Don't use TnT-LLM as is. Keep its pattern, replace\nthe expensive steps:\n• Cluster the gte vectors first (free); the LLM only\n  names ~2,000 clusters from ~10 titles each (≈ 4M\n  tokens, ≈ $3).\n• Titles instead of LLM summaries (summaries\n  stopped, see step 5 of the semantic search\n  failures map).\n• Taxonomy from a small sample; a small model or\n  vector similarity assigns the rest (TopicGPT: open\n  models assign well, but create taxonomies poorly).",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "customData": {
    "map": "card-text",
    "card": "dg_n19"
   }
  },
