    "map": "card",
    "id": "dg_n20",
    "kind": "open",
    "color": "3",
    "md": "### ? Next\n**Free check:** cluster the corpus and see whether each of the 46 failures' right document sits in a small cluster with its look-alikes (e.g. qst_0178 in a \"precision annealing\" cluster, not among 108k quantization docs).\n\n**Watch:** when new documents arrive, the buckets must stay accurate for the old ones. A fixed taxonomy lowers this risk but doesn't remove it, so test adding documents too."
   }
  },
