   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "dg_g2",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 2 · Keyword routing (9 Nov)\n**Idea:** no clustering; a small model labels the data.\n1. The SLM writes keywords for each document (feature, project, concept; not names or ids).\n2. An LLM deduplicates them into one canonical list, with a mapping.\n3. Store each keyword, its embedding and its documents.\n4. Search the keywords by meaning; they **route** to a small group, and the reranker ranks inside it."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "text-dg_g2-0",
