   "text": "Idea: no clustering; a small model labels the data.\n1. The SLM writes keywords for each document\n    (feature, project, concept; not names or ids).\n2. An LLM deduplicates them into one canonical list,\n    with a mapping.\n3. Store each keyword, its embedding and its\n    documents.\n4. Search the keywords by meaning; they route to a\n    small group, and the reranker ranks inside it.",
   "originalText": "Idea: no clustering; a small model labels the data.\n1. The SLM writes keywords for each document\n    (feature, project, concept; not names or ids).\n2. An LLM deduplicates them into one canonical list,\n    with a mapping.\n3. Store each keyword, its embedding and its\n    documents.\n4. Search the keywords by meaning; they route to a\n    small group, and the reranker ranks inside it.",
