   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "dg_g2a",
    "kind": "decision",
    "color": "4",
    "md": "### ✓ Why it fits growth\n- A new document only gets keywords from the SLM and is mapped onto the existing list. Old documents are never re-labelled.\n- Two keywords found to be the same later → one row in the mapping.\n- Small: tens of thousands of keyword vectors, not millions."
   }
  },
