    "map": "card",
    "id": "dg_g2b",
    "kind": "open",
    "color": "3",
    "md": "### ? Watch / next\n- Keywords must be **feature-level**: a topic like \"quantization\" (108k docs) routes nowhere.\n- Very common keywords and names are noise.\n- The question must be turned into keyword phrases first.\n- **Free test:** with the DeepSeek entities of the 46 failures' candidates, does the question reach a small group that holds the right document?"
   }
  },
