   "updated": 1795607209687,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• Keywords must be feature-level: a topic like\n  \"quantization\" (108k docs) routes nowhere.\n• Very common keywords and names are noise.\n• The question must be turned into keyword\n  phrases first.\n• Free test: with the DeepSeek entities of the 46\n  failures' candidates, does the question reach a\n  small group that holds the right document?",
   "originalText": "• Keywords must be feature-level: a topic like\n  \"quantization\" (108k docs) routes nowhere.\n• Very common keywords and names are noise.\n• The question must be turned into keyword\n  phrases first.\n• Free test: with the DeepSeek entities of the 46\n  failures' candidates, does the question reach a\n  small group that holds the right document?",
