   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "ab_p0",
    "kind": "problem",
    "color": "6",
    "md": "# The LLM answers when it should say \"I don't know\"\nWhen search misses the right document, the system should reply \"I could not find this information\". Our agents often answer from a near-duplicate instead.\n\nFound on 9 Nov 2026 while testing clarifying questions on the 46 semantic failures. Not solved yet: a problem for later."
   }
  },
