   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "ab_s1",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 1 · Measure abstention when search misses\n**Why:** how often does the LLM admit it has no answer when the right document isn't among the documents it retrieved? Semantic questions, Gemini judge.\n- ✓ **Pipeline** (one search, run 15): right doc missed in 56 → **80% \"could not find\"**, 20% answered anyway.\n- ✗ **Snippet agent** (run 18): missed in 49 → only **39% \"could not find\"**, **59% answered anyway** (wrong).\n- ✗ Same on the 46 failures (runs 28–30): 43–51% \"could not find\", 49–58% answered anyway.\n- When the right doc *was* found, almost every answer is correct (68 of 69, 75 of 76)."
   }
  },
