    "map": "card",
    "id": "ab_s1n",
    "kind": "open",
    "color": "3",
    "md": "### ? Next (not started)\n- **Rate the agents' \"answered anyway\" answers** like article 004 (does the cited document answer?): ~$1 Gemini. Tells real hallucinations from ambiguous questions.\n- Ideas to test: a **verify step** (does the chosen document really answer *this* question, or a near-duplicate?), a stricter \"answer only if…\" prompt, scoring abstention in the evaluation (a wrong answer worse than \"I don't know\").\n- Watch: clarifying questions and a source filter may change this rate."
   }
