    "id": "d_s7",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 7 · Dev-contradictions set (18 Nov)\n**Why:** to calibrate when the agent should ask, we need questions with a known answer to \"do the top results disagree?\". Built from the 200 Slack dev questions and the documents both setups showed (right thread + final top 5 of today's search and of agent v3 top 100).\n- Code: `exploration/slack_extraction/contradictions.py` → `data/dev_contradictions.jsonl`."
   }
  },
