    "map": "card",
    "id": "d_s7a",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 7a · Compare answers side by side\n**Why:** the ambiguity judge rated each document alone. Two \"full\" documents can be the same case (no need to ask) or different cases (ask). Gemini compared each answering document's answer + quote with the right thread's (189 questions, 772 answers):\n- same case, consistent: 87\n- same case, conflicting facts: 159\n- different case: 526\n- ✗ Real conflicts: 135 of 189 questions (71%), not 76.5%."
   }
  },
