    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 7b · Classes\n- **Consistent (28):** every other answering document agrees with the right thread, or none answers.\n- **Ambiguous (135):** another document answers fully with a different case or conflicting facts. 28 kept.\n- Excluded (26): conflicts only with partial answers."
