    "md": "## 7c · Specific questions, created and verified\n**Why:** the dev questions are vague on purpose, so none names the detail that picks the right thread.\n- Gemini adds one detail the person would know (channel, customer, team, environment, time); no answer, ids, numbers or names.\n- ✓ Kept only if the right thread still answers fully and every conflicting document now rates \"none\"; up to 3 attempts.\n- ✓ 56 of 107 verified; 28 used.\n- ✗ First pass let a ticket id through: details with digits now rejected."
   }
