   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "d_s9",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 9 · SLM training plan: all sources (20 Nov)\n**Why:** field search needs fields for the whole corpus (511,962 documents), not the 24k DeepSeek labelled. One Qwen3.5-2B LoRA for every source, so nothing is left for later.\n- Labels: 12,930 for training (6,289 Slack, 5,640 other sources, 1,001 questions) + ~2,000 extra for the thin sources.\n- Weights & Biases logging (project train-rag-fields).\n- Todo: [[Train the Slack field extractor SLM]]"
   }
  },
