    "map": "card",
    "id": "d_s9a",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 9a · Train / held-out split\nThe near 50/50 comes from the 200 dev questions: half B's 12,531 candidate documents are never trained on, so the field-search test can be rerun with the SLM's own fields fairly.\n- ✗ 70/30 re-split: leaves 60 questions for that test, too few with 6–10 points of run-to-run noise.\n- ✓ ~2,000 extra DeepSeek labels instead (≈ $2.10): Gmail is 24% of the corpus but 9% of training."
   }
  },
