    "map": "card",
    "id": "d_s9c",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 9c · Cost plan (fine-tuning first)\n- 2,000 extra labels: ≈ $2.10\n- Smoke run + setup: ≈ $1.00\n- LoRA, 2 epochs, ~14.9k examples, ≈ 6.5 h on a 4090: ≈ $2.70\n- Scoring 12.5k held-out: ≈ $0.20\n- Fees, failed boots: ≈ $0.50–1.00\n- **Total ≈ $6.50–7** (+ ≈ $3 for a second run)\n- Then mining 512k documents: ≈ $9–13 (DeepSeek: ≈ $500)."
   }
  },
