    "map": "card",
    "id": "d_s9d",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 9d · Training run fields-r16-e2 (20–21 Nov)\n**Why:** one LoRA (Qwen3.5-2B, r16, 2 epochs) on DeepSeek's labels for every source.\n- ✓ Extra labels: 1,998 of 2,000, DeepSeek $1.84 → 14,919 training examples.\n- ✓ 1,866 steps in 9.6 h on an RTX 4090 ($0.40/h, fast DeltaNet kernels); planned 6.5 h.\n- ✓ Loss 0.46 → 0.14; eval loss (400 held-out) 0.247 → 0.171, flat from step ~1,600: no overfitting, a third epoch would add little.\n- ✗ First attempt lost: ssh dropped during setup, slow path (68 s/step), destroyed ($0.46). Scripts hardened (timeouts, detached jobs).\n- First look, 20 held-out docs: JSON valid 100%, mean field F1 vs DeepSeek 0.78. Weak: decision 0.30, impact 0.40, action_item 0.56.\n- **Cost:** $1.84 labels + $5.23 GPU = **$7.07** (plan ≈ $6.50–7).\n- W&B: rag-train/train-rag-fields, run fields-r16-e2."
   }
  },
