   "text": "Why: one LoRA (Qwen3.5-2B, r16, 2 epochs) on\nDeepSeek's labels for every source.\n• ✓ Extra labels: 1,998 of 2,000, DeepSeek $1.84\n  → 14,919 training examples.\n• ✓ 1,866 steps in 9.6 h on an RTX 4090 ($0.40/h,\n  fast DeltaNet kernels); planned 6.5 h.\n• ✓ Loss 0.46 → 0.14; eval loss (400 held-out)\n  0.247 → 0.171, flat from step ~1,600: no\n  overfitting, a third epoch would add little.\n• ✗ First attempt lost: ssh dropped during setup,\n  slow path (68 s/step), destroyed ($0.46). Scripts\n  hardened (timeouts, detached jobs).\n• First look, 20 held-out docs: JSON valid 100%,\n  mean field F1 vs DeepSeek 0.78. Weak: decision\n  0.30, impact 0.40, action_item 0.56.\n• Cost: $1.84 labels + $5.23 GPU = $7.07 (plan ≈\n  $6.50–7).\n• W&B: rag-train/train-rag-fields, run fields-r16-e2.",
   "originalText": "Why: one LoRA (Qwen3.5-2B, r16, 2 epochs) on\nDeepSeek's labels for every source.\n• ✓ Extra labels: 1,998 of 2,000, DeepSeek $1.84\n  → 14,919 training examples.\n• ✓ 1,866 steps in 9.6 h on an RTX 4090 ($0.40/h,\n  fast DeltaNet kernels); planned 6.5 h.\n• ✓ Loss 0.46 → 0.14; eval loss (400 held-out)\n  0.247 → 0.171, flat from step ~1,600: no\n  overfitting, a third epoch would add little.\n• ✗ First attempt lost: ssh dropped during setup,\n  slow path (68 s/step), destroyed ($0.46). Scripts\n  hardened (timeouts, detached jobs).\n• First look, 20 held-out docs: JSON valid 100%,\n  mean field F1 vs DeepSeek 0.78. Weak: decision\n  0.30, impact 0.40, action_item 0.56.\n• Cost: $1.84 labels + $5.23 GPU = $7.07 (plan ≈\n  $6.50–7).\n• W&B: rag-train/train-rag-fields, run fields-r16-e2.",
