    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 9e · Held-out score: 12,711 documents (21 Nov)\n**Why:** decide on all held-out documents, per source, whether the SLM can replace DeepSeek for mining.\n- ✓ JSON valid 99.5%; 0.4% hit the token limit. 80 min of vLLM on one 4090, $0.74.\n- ✓ Every source close: word F1 0.73 (Fireflies) – 0.81 (Gmail); Slack 0.79; all 0.785.\n- ✓ Names as DeepSeek writes them (exact value F1): person 0.98, client 0.90, region 0.88, identifier 0.81.\n- Phrases agree in words, not wording: topic 0.75 word / 0.16 exact; bug, cause, fix alike.\n- ✗ Weak: decision 0.55, impact 0.59 (judgement fields).\n- Zero-shot GLiNER: 0.41 exact vs DeepSeek (13 threads); SLM: 0.57.\n- Fine-tuning total: **$7.84**.\n- Report: exploration/slm_fields/runs/fields-r16-e2/score.md"
   }
  },
