    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 9f · Fine-tuning works: field search on the SLM's fields (22 Nov)\n**Why:** agreeing with DeepSeek isn't the goal; finding the right thread is.\nHalf B's 100 dev questions, pool = 12,511 held-out documents, the same field search with each extractor's own fields; no agent, no reranker.\n- ✓ Top 10 / 50 / 100: DeepSeek 38 / 68 / 80, **SLM 38 / 66 / 80** (median rank 19 vs 23).\n- ✗ Slightly weaker deeper: top 300 90% vs 96%.\n- Not compared with the hybrid search: the pipeline runs both together.\n- Report: exploration/slm_fields/runs/fields-r16-e2/field_search.md"
   }
  },
