   "link": "[[Run the final evaluation]]",
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "ev1",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 1 · Evaluation drift and the update design (23 Nov)\n**Why:** answers now name a main case plus similar cases, the agent asks a simulated person, and the set has no off-topic questions.\n- 8 drifts listed: `docs/brainstorm/007_evaluation_drift.md`\n- Design: `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-23-evaluation-update-design.md`\n- ✓ Judge strict + lenient; ambiguity labels with alternate gold; memory notes v3 in tiers\n- ✓ Retrieval (MRR, nDCG, hit rate), RAGAS (own judge + `ragas` on ~100), agent effort, stage timing\n- ✓ Off-topic set (generated + hand review, see budget); refusal as a 4th verdict in the check\n- Todo: [[Run the final evaluation]] (its task checklist)"
   }
  },
