   "originalText": "Why: answers now name a main case plus similar\ncases, the agent asks a simulated person, and the\nset has no off-topic questions.\n• 8 drifts listed:\n  docs/brainstorm/007_evaluation_drift.md\n• Design:\n  docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-23-evaluation-\n  update-design.md\n• ✓ Judge strict + lenient; ambiguity labels with\n  alternate gold; memory notes v3 in tiers\n• ✓ Retrieval (MRR, nDCG, hit rate), RAGAS (own\n  judge + ragas on ~100), agent effort, stage timing\n• ✓ Off-topic set (generated + hand review, see\n  budget); refusal as a 4th verdict in the check\n• Todo: Run the final evaluation (its task checklist)",
