   "link": "[[Run the final evaluation]]",
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "ev1_budget",
    "kind": "decision",
    "color": "4",
    "md": "### ✓ Decision (23 Nov): budget scope\nThe full plan (both systems, 2–3 repeats) came to ≈ $115–160: too much.\n- ✓ Only `field-agent-clarify`, one run (≈ $24); the report states it is a single run (agent noise 6–10 points).\n- ✓ Off-topic set: one Gemini call + local search flag + hand review (< $0.05) instead of rated rounds (≈ $10–16, parked: `off-topic-set-verified-rounds`).\n- ✓ RAGAS on a stratified sample of 100 questions (type exact, gold source within 2 points), not all 575.\n- Whole evaluation ≈ $32–36; per-task costs and possible cuts in [[Run the final evaluation]]."
   }
  },
