   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "ev2",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 2 · Semantic retrieval first, before the full run (23 Nov)\n**Why:** the full run costs ≈ $32–36, and its open question is the 125 semantic questions (run 31: 54.4% correct, document recall 57.6%). The answer step is ≈ 96% right when the right document reaches it (answer_check, 20 Nov), so **retrieval decides the semantic score**; it can be measured alone for ≈ $2–3.\n- Fields for the whole corpus first: import + embed the SLM's fields of all 511,958 documents (free, local)\n- `evaluate-search --retriever field-agent --question-type semantic`: the agent's searches (general + field) and its check, no answer, no asking; ranking = its final 5, then the other candidates by reranker score\n- Baseline, free: `--retriever hybrid-ft-union` (today's first search alone)\n- Reported: recall@1 / 5 / 10 / 20 for both"
   }
  },
