   "text": "2 · Semantic retrieval first, before the\nfull run (23 Nov)",
   "originalText": "2 · Semantic retrieval first, before the\nfull run (23 Nov)",
   "fontSize": 26,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "customData": {
    "map": "card-text",
    "card": "ev2"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "text-ev2-1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 12100.0,
   "y": 1764.0,
   "width": 460.18,
   "height": 450.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "g-ev2"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 726732751,
   "version": 22,
   "versionNonce": 964202080,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795607209709,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why: the full run costs ≈ $32–36, and its open\nquestion is the 125 semantic questions (run 31:\n54.4% correct, document recall 57.6%). The answer\nstep is ≈ 96% right when the right document\nreaches it (answer_check, 20 Nov), so retrieval\ndecides the semantic score; it can be measured\nalone for ≈ $2–3.\n• Fields for the whole corpus first: import + embed\n  the SLM's fields of all 511,958 documents (free,\n  local)\n• evaluate-search --retriever field-agent\n  --question-type semantic: the agent's searches\n  (general + field) and its check, no answer, no\n  asking; ranking = its final 5, then the other\n  candidates by reranker score\n• Baseline, free: --retriever hybrid-ft-union (today's\n  first search alone)\n• Reported: recall@1 / 5 / 10 / 20 for both",
   "originalText": "Why: the full run costs ≈ $32–36, and its open\nquestion is the 125 semantic questions (run 31:\n54.4% correct, document recall 57.6%). The answer\nstep is ≈ 96% right when the right document\nreaches it (answer_check, 20 Nov), so retrieval\ndecides the semantic score; it can be measured\nalone for ≈ $2–3.\n• Fields for the whole corpus first: import + embed\n  the SLM's fields of all 511,958 documents (free,\n  local)\n• evaluate-search --retriever field-agent\n  --question-type semantic: the agent's searches\n  (general + field) and its check, no answer, no\n  asking; ranking = its final 5, then the other\n  candidates by reranker score\n• Baseline, free: --retriever hybrid-ft-union (today's\n  first search alone)\n• Reported: recall@1 / 5 / 10 / 20 for both",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "customData": {
    "map": "card-text",
    "card": "ev2"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "card-ev2_dec",
