   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "ev2_dec",
    "kind": "decision",
    "color": "4",
    "md": "### ✓ Decision (23 Nov): measure retrieval on the semantic questions before paying for the full run\nThe full run waits for this number. Lenient semantic accuracy ≈ recall@5 × 0.96, so the check tells most of the final semantic score for ≈ $2–3 instead of ≈ $20.\n- Without asking: asking showed no gain on the Slack dev set and needs the simulated person.\n- recall@8–10 shows what answering from more documents would add (free)."
   }
  },
  {
