   "text": "The full run waits for this number. Lenient semantic\naccuracy ≈ recall@5 × 0.96, so the check tells most\nof the final semantic score for ≈ $2–3 instead of ≈\n$20.\n• Without asking: asking showed no gain on the\n  Slack dev set and needs the simulated person.\n• recall@8–10 shows what answering from more\n  documents would add (free).",
