   "updated": 1795607209709,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "ev2_next",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "### Result (24 Nov): the agent ranks better at the top, not wider\nAll 125 semantic questions, 511,958 documents, field search over the whole corpus (StreamingDiskANN).\n\n| | R@1 | R@5 | R@10 | R@20 |\n|---|--:|--:|--:|--:|\n| first search (`hybrid-ft-union`, no rewrites) | 47.2% | 62.4% | 68.8% | 71.2% |\n| agent (`field-agent`, rewrites on general searches) | **60.8%** | 61.6% | 70.4% | 73.6% |\n\n- ✓ +13.6 points at rank 1: the agent's check puts the right case first\n- ✗ recall@5 no better: when the right document isn't first, it is almost never at 2–5\n- Cost: 907 Gemini calls, $3.83 (≈ $0.03 per question). A first 90-question run ($2.69) gave the same picture."
   }
  },
