   "updated": 1795607209710,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• ✓ +13.6 points at rank 1: the agent's check puts\n  the right case first\n• ✗ recall@5 no better: when the right document\n  isn't first, it is almost never at 2–5\n• Cost: 907 Gemini calls, $3.83 (≈ $0.03 per\n  question). A first 90-question run ($2.69) gave the\n  same picture.",
   "originalText": "• ✓ +13.6 points at rank 1: the agent's check puts\n  the right case first\n• ✗ recall@5 no better: when the right document\n  isn't first, it is almost never at 2–5\n• Cost: 907 Gemini calls, $3.83 (≈ $0.03 per\n  question). A first 90-question run ($2.69) gave the\n  same picture.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
