   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "ev2_next2",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "### Finding (24 Nov): where the agent loses the expected document\nFrom the per-question logs (`evaluate-search --log`), 125 questions:\n- 76 first; 1 at 2–5\n- **10 picked by the agent, then pushed to 6–20 by the final rerank**: the expected document trails the top by 0.01–0.06; the reranker reads only title + chunk cut at 1,024 tokens (≈ 4,000 chars) of 4–9k-char documents\n- 5 not picked, at 6–20; 9 seen by a search, below 20\n- **24 never in any search's top 50**: a search problem\n- only 3 misses are \"several cases fit\": ambiguity is small"
   }
  },
