    "map": "card",
    "id": "ev2_next3",
    "kind": "open",
    "color": "3",
    "md": "### ? Next: two free fixes, then the 24 search misses\nBoth measured offline from the logged runs, no Gemini:\n- keep the agent's picks in the final 5 (up to +8 points at rank 5)\n- rerank the final candidates on 8,192 tokens instead of 1,024\n- read the 24 search misses on the review page (`exploration/field_agent_review/review.py`) and note what query would have found them"
   }
  },
