   "link": "[[Investigate the reranker cost and how to reduce it]]",
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "rp0",
    "kind": "problem",
    "color": "6",
    "md": "# Reranker price on AWS\n**Why:** on AWS the reranker turns out to be most of the bill. Each question reranks up to 100 documents of up to 1,024 tokens on a GPU, while the embedder and ingestion cost little.\n- Target used for sizing: 25 questions/s (what one query-service task handled in the load test)\n- Todo: [[Investigate the reranker cost and how to reduce it]]\n- Write-up: article 011, \"What the models cost on AWS\" (AWS-architecture-research workspace)"
   }
  },
