   "text": "Why: on AWS the reranker turns out to be most of\nthe bill. Each question reranks up to 100 documents\nof up to 1,024 tokens on a GPU, while the\nembedder and ingestion cost little.\n• Target used for sizing: 25 questions/s (what one\n  query-service task handled in the load test)\n• Todo: Investigate the reranker cost and how to\n  reduce it\n• Write-up: article 011, \"What the models cost on\n  AWS\" (AWS-architecture-research workspace)",
   "originalText": "Why: on AWS the reranker turns out to be most of\nthe bill. Each question reranks up to 100 documents\nof up to 1,024 tokens on a GPU, while the\nembedder and ingestion cost little.\n• Target used for sizing: 25 questions/s (what one\n  query-service task handled in the load test)\n• Todo: Investigate the reranker cost and how to\n  reduce it\n• Write-up: article 011, \"What the models cost on\n  AWS\" (AWS-architecture-research workspace)",
