   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "rp1",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "## 1 · GPU benchmark and cost projection (24 Nov)\n**Idea:** measure the real models on the local GPU (RTX 2000 Ada laptop, the same architecture as the L4), then project to SageMaker.\n- Pipeline settings: float16, real questions and documents\n- Projection: an L4 or A10G is 2–3× faster than the local GPU (a 4090 was ~5× faster)\n- Prices: ml.g6.xlarge (L4) ~$1.13/h, ml.g5.xlarge (A10G) ~$1.41/h"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "text-rp1-0",
