   "updated": 1795607209713,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "rp1_res",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "### Result (24 Nov): the reranker sets the cost\n| Setting | Local GPU | L4s for 25 q/s | Per month |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 100 docs × 1,024 tok | 2.65 s/q | ~25–30 | ~$21–25k |\n| 50 docs × 1,024 tok | 1.37 s/q | | |\n| 100 docs × 512 tok | 1.18 s/q | | |\n| 50 docs × 512 tok | 0.62 s/q | ~5–8 | ~$4–6.5k |\n- ✗ 100 × 1,024 (today's field agent) also adds ~1.1 s to every answer\n- One L4 at 50 × 512 ≈ 4 q/s ≈ 300k questions/day, which may cover real traffic"
   }
  },
