    "map": "card",
    "id": "rp1_cheap",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "### Finding (24 Nov): everything else is cheap\n- ✓ Embedder: 200 questions/s in batches of 8 on the local GPU, so it can share the reranker's GPU (only a short wait when questions overlap)\n- ✗ Embedder on the CPU as it runs today: 0.75–1.8 s per question\n- ✓ Ingestion: ~$0.15–0.25 per 1,000 documents (SLM on an async endpoint); first load of 500k ≈ $75–125"
   }
  },
