    "map": "card",
    "id": "rp1_next",
    "kind": "open",
    "color": "3",
    "md": "### ? Next: quality against cost, then cheaper setups\n- Recall and answer quality at 100/50 docs × 1,024/512 tokens\n- One hour on a real L4 to replace the projection (paid: ask first)\n- Price the ways to cut it: shared GPU, working hours only, EC2 instead of SageMaker, T4, a smaller or distilled reranker, ONNX/TensorRT, rerank only when unsure, caching\n- Get expected traffic (questions/day and peak)"
   }
  },
