    "map": "card",
    "id": "rp2_bench",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "### Result (24 Nov): +13.6 points at rank 5 on the benchmark\n125 semantic questions, 511,958 documents, same 50 candidates:\n\n| | R@1 | R@5 | R@10 | R@20 |\n|---|--:|--:|--:|--:|\n| no reranker (hybrid-ft) | 20.8% | 44.0% | 51.2% | 56.0% |\n| reranker, full text | 46.4% | 57.6% | 59.2% | 63.2% |\n\n- ✓ ≈ +13 points of semantic accuracy (accuracy ≈ R@5 × 0.96)\n- Full text: 3.9 s per question on the laptop GPU vs 0.6 s without"
   }
  },
