   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "rp2_dev",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "### Result (24 Nov): the dev reranking set, split into its two parts\nCE = cross-encoder (gte-reranker-modernbert).\n380 questions, ~97 candidates each. A question succeeds only if the first search finds the right document (cov., coverage) and the reranker then puts it in the top 5 (rerank@5, counted on covered questions). total@5 = both together.\n\n| | cov. | rerank@5 | total@5 |\n|---|--:|--:|--:|\n| no reranker | 51.3% | 43.6% | 22.4% |\n| CE 1,024 | 51.3% | 79.5% | 40.8% |\n| CE 8,192 | 51.3% | 79.0% | 40.5% |\n\n- ✗ Coverage is the bigger limit: the right document reaches the reranker for only half the questions (dev 59.4%, dev_slack 44.0%)\n- ✓ The cross-encoder finds it 4 times in 5 when it is there; 1,024 tokens is as good as 8,192 at 2.5× less time"
   }
  },
