   "updated": 1795607209719,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• ✗ Coverage is the bigger limit: the right document\n  reaches the reranker for only half the questions\n  (dev 59.4%, dev_slack 44.0%)\n• ✓ The cross-encoder finds it 4 times in 5 when it is\n  there; 1,024 tokens is as good as 8,192 at 2.5×\n  less time",
   "originalText": "• ✗ Coverage is the bigger limit: the right document\n  reaches the reranker for only half the questions\n  (dev 59.4%, dev_slack 44.0%)\n• ✓ The cross-encoder finds it 4 times in 5 when it is\n  there; 1,024 tokens is as good as 8,192 at 2.5×\n  less time",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
