    "map": "card",
    "id": "rp2_next",
    "kind": "open",
    "color": "3",
    "md": "### ? Next: score alternatives on the dev set\n- Bar: answered@5 ≈ 84%, answered@1 ≈ 63% (strict R@5 79.5% on the 195 with the source among candidates)\n- Before trusting a new reranker: rate its unlabelled top-5 documents through the same cache (~$0.002 each)\n- Also report top-5 agreement with today's reranker\n- First candidates: a ColBERT model (late interaction), a smaller cross-encoder, 512 tokens, 50 documents"
   }
  },
