   "text": "• Bar: answered@5 ≈ 84%, answered@1 ≈ 63%\n  (strict R@5 79.5% on the 195 with the source\n  among candidates)\n• Before trusting a new reranker: rate its unlabelled\n  top-5 documents through the same cache\n  (~$0.002 each)\n• Also report top-5 agreement with today's reranker\n• First candidates: a ColBERT model (late\n  interaction), a smaller cross-encoder, 512 tokens,\n  50 documents",
   "originalText": "• Bar: answered@5 ≈ 84%, answered@1 ≈ 63%\n  (strict R@5 79.5% on the 195 with the source\n  among candidates)\n• Before trusting a new reranker: rate its unlabelled\n  top-5 documents through the same cache\n  (~$0.002 each)\n• Also report top-5 agreement with today's reranker\n• First candidates: a ColBERT model (late\n  interaction), a smaller cross-encoder, 512 tokens,\n  50 documents",
