   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "rp2_ans",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "### Result (24 Nov): counting every answering document as right\nGemini rated each top-5 document on its own (full / partial / none, the 17 Nov method; $3.29). answered@5 = the top 5 holds the source or a document rated \"full\". This is end to end.\n\n| | strict@5 | ans@5 | ans@1 |\n|---|--:|--:|--:|\n| no reranker* | 22.4% | ≥48.7% | ≥19.7% |\n| CE 1,024 | 40.8% | 83.7% | 63.4% |\n\n*partly labelled: a lower bound.\n- ✓ Most \"misses\" are other documents that answer too, in dev (46.7% → 83.9%) as much as in dev_slack (35.5% → 83.5%)\n- It measures retrieval and reranking, not final answer correctness: near-twins with other facts count as answering"
   }
  },
