   "text": "*partly labelled: a lower bound.\n• ✓ Most \"misses\" are other documents that answer\n  too, in dev (46.7% → 83.9%) as much as in\n  dev_slack (35.5% → 83.5%)\n• It measures retrieval and reranking, not final\n  answer correctness: near-twins with other facts\n  count as answering",
