   "text": "Idea: ColBERT (late interaction) does the document\nwork once, at ingestion, by storing a vector for\nevery token. A question then costs one short\nencoding plus a cheap MaxSim over the stored\nvectors: 14 ms instead of the cross-encoder's 2.4 s.",
   "originalText": "Idea: ColBERT (late interaction) does the document\nwork once, at ingestion, by storing a vector for\nevery token. A question then costs one short\nencoding plus a cheap MaxSim over the stored\nvectors: 14 ms instead of the cross-encoder's 2.4 s.",
   "fontSize": 20,
