   "updated": 1795607209728,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Tested on the dev reranking set in two roles:\nreplacing the cross-encoder, and as a pre-filter that\npasses only its best N candidates to the\ncross-encoder.\n• LateOn (LightOn, 149M, ModernBERT) beat\n  GTE-ModernColBERT and was used for the\n  comparison\n• No new library: sentence-transformers'\n  MultiVectorEncoder",
   "originalText": "Tested on the dev reranking set in two roles:\nreplacing the cross-encoder, and as a pre-filter that\npasses only its best N candidates to the\ncross-encoder.\n• LateOn (LightOn, 149M, ModernBERT) beat\n  GTE-ModernColBERT and was used for the\n  comparison\n• No new library: sentence-transformers'\n  MultiVectorEncoder",
   "fontSize": 20,
