   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "rp3_res",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "### Result (24 Nov): as a pre-filter it keeps today's quality\nSame ~97 candidates for every setup, so coverage is the same (51.3%) and the differences are the reranker's own. rerank@5 = right document in the top 5 when it is among the candidates; ans@5 = an answering document in the top 5.\n\n| Setup | rerank@5 | ans@5 | CE work |\n|---|--:|--:|--:|\n| CE today | 79.5% | 83.7% | 100% |\n| top 30 + CE | 79.0% | 83.7% | 31% |\n| top 10 + CE | 75.9% | 82.4% | 10% |\n| LateOn only | 71.8% | 80.3% | 0% |\n\n- ✓ Top 30: the same quality for a third of the reranker GPU time\n- Top 10: 1–4 points lower for a tenth\n- ✗ Alone: 3–8 points lower, worth it only if cost matters more than those points"
   }
  },
