  {
   "id": "text-rp3_cost-1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 16020.0,
   "y": 4827.5,
   "width": 453.04,
   "height": 225.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "g-rp3_cost"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1465545937,
   "version": 20,
   "versionNonce": 1554111406,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795607209730,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• Indexing costs about as much as embedding: one\n  pass per document (~28 per second on the laptop\n  GPU)\n• It stores ~780 vectors per document: ~100 GB for\n  the corpus, ~13 GB compressed. Cheap to store;\n  keep them in RAM or on local disk so reads stay\n  fast\n• At 25 questions/s the reranker GPUs drop from\n  ~25–30 L4s to ~8–9 (top 30) or ~3 (top 10)",
   "originalText": "• Indexing costs about as much as embedding: one\n  pass per document (~28 per second on the laptop\n  GPU)\n• It stores ~780 vectors per document: ~100 GB for\n  the corpus, ~13 GB compressed. Cheap to store;\n  keep them in RAM or on local disk so reads stay\n  fast\n• At 25 questions/s the reranker GPUs drop from\n  ~25–30 L4s to ~8–9 (top 30) or ~3 (top 10)",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "customData": {
    "map": "card-text",
    "card": "rp3_cost"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "card-rp3_next",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 16600.0,
   "y": 3385.0,
   "width": 520,
   "height": 730,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#17809a",
   "backgroundColor": "#e2f4f8",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
