   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795607209731,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Idea: LateOn is cheap enough to rerank far more\ncandidates than the cross-encoder, so ask gte and\nBM25 for more than their top 50 each and let\nLateOn sort them. All 380 dev questions, end to\nend; ans@5 = the top 5 holds a document that\nanswers the question (Gemini labels, $1.46 for the\nnew pairs).",
   "originalText": "Idea: LateOn is cheap enough to rerank far more\ncandidates than the cross-encoder, so ask gte and\nBM25 for more than their top 50 each and let\nLateOn sort them. All 380 dev questions, end to\nend; ans@5 = the top 5 holds a document that\nanswers the question (Gemini labels, $1.46 for the\nnew pairs).",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
