  {
   "id": "text-rp3_next-32",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 16620.0,
   "y": 3797.25,
   "width": 443.2,
   "height": 300.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "g-rp3_next"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1463050308,
   "version": 3,
   "versionNonce": 1948721252,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795607209732,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• ✓ Top 100 per search is the best depth: ans@5\n  +1.3 points (about 5 questions, within noise), still\n  1.6 behind the cross-encoder\n• ✗ Deeper than 100 gets worse: coverage grows,\n  but LateOn lets more wrong documents into the\n  top 5; ans@1 doesn't move at any depth\n• ✗ Whole documents (8,192 tokens) are worse at\n  every depth (total@5 33.9% at 50 vs 36.8% at\n  1,024): long documents get more chances to\n  match, and LateOn was trained on short ones\n• Cost: about 47 ms per question at ~380\n  candidates vs 14 ms at ~97",
   "originalText": "• ✓ Top 100 per search is the best depth: ans@5\n  +1.3 points (about 5 questions, within noise), still\n  1.6 behind the cross-encoder\n• ✗ Deeper than 100 gets worse: coverage grows,\n  but LateOn lets more wrong documents into the\n  top 5; ans@1 doesn't move at any depth\n• ✗ Whole documents (8,192 tokens) are worse at\n  every depth (total@5 33.9% at 50 vs 36.8% at\n  1,024): long documents get more chances to\n  match, and LateOn was trained on short ones\n• Cost: about 47 ms per question at ~380\n  candidates vs 14 ms at ~97",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "customData": {
    "map": "card-text",
    "card": "rp3_next"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "card-rp3_dec",
