   "updated": 1795607209732,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "rp3_dec",
    "kind": "decision",
    "color": "4",
    "md": "### ✓ Decision (24 Nov): LateOn replaces the cross-encoder\nFor the price, LateOn alone is good enough: rerank@5 71.8% vs 79.5% and ans@5 80.3% vs 83.7%, at no reranker GPU cost (14 ms per question, vectors stored at ingestion).\n- The cross-encoder stays an option on LateOn's top 10–30 if those few points matter later\n- Next: try other late-interaction models, and wider candidates"
   }
  },
  {
