   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795607209732,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "For the price, LateOn alone is good enough:\nrerank@5 71.8% vs 79.5% and ans@5 80.3% vs\n83.7%, at no reranker GPU cost (14 ms per\nquestion, vectors stored at ingestion).\n• The cross-encoder stays an option on LateOn's\n  top 10–30 if those few points matter later\n• Next: try other late-interaction models, and wider\n  candidates",
   "originalText": "For the price, LateOn alone is good enough:\nrerank@5 71.8% vs 79.5% and ans@5 80.3% vs\n83.7%, at no reranker GPU cost (14 ms per\nquestion, vectors stored at ingestion).\n• The cross-encoder stays an option on LateOn's\n  top 10–30 if those few points matter later\n• Next: try other late-interaction models, and wider\n  candidates",
   "fontSize": 20,
