   "updated": 1795607209732,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "rp3_models",
    "kind": "step",
    "color": "5",
    "md": "### Result (24 Nov): other late-interaction models, LateOn wins\nSame ~97 candidates; rerank@k = right document in the top k when it is among the candidates.\n\n| Model | rerank@1 | rerank@5 |\n|---|--:|--:|\n| CE today | 51.3% | 79.5% |\n| LateOn | 48.2% | 71.8% |\n| ColBERT-Zero | 35.9% | 71.3% |\n| Reason-ModernColBERT | 34.4% | 64.6% |\n| GTE-ModernColBERT | 35.4% | 62.6% |\n\n- ✓ LateOn is best or tied everywhere\n- ColBERT-Zero ties it at rank 5 but is 12 points worse at rank 1\n- ✗ Reason-ModernColBERT: reasoning tuning doesn't help here, and it is non-commercial (CC-BY-NC)\n- All run at 14–15 ms per question"
   }
  },
