   "updated": 1795607209733,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• ✓ LateOn is best or tied everywhere\n• ColBERT-Zero ties it at rank 5 but is 12 points\n  worse at rank 1\n• ✗ Reason-ModernColBERT: reasoning tuning\n  doesn't help here, and it is non-commercial\n  (CC-BY-NC)\n• All run at 14–15 ms per question",
   "originalText": "• ✓ LateOn is best or tied everywhere\n• ColBERT-Zero ties it at rank 5 but is 12 points\n  worse at rank 1\n• ✗ Reason-ModernColBERT: reasoning tuning\n  doesn't help here, and it is non-commercial\n  (CC-BY-NC)\n• All run at 14–15 ms per question",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
