    "md": "### ✓ Decision (25 Nov): 100 candidates per search for LateOn\ngte and BM25 each hand over their top 100 (~190 candidates), and LateOn at 1,024 tokens ranks them all: ans@5 82.1% (vs 80.8% at 50, cross-encoder today 83.7%), about 25–30 ms per question.\n- Applies when LateOn goes into the pipeline (prod-code step); today's pipeline keeps 50\n- Next lever for the remaining gap: fine-tune LateOn on our training questions (hard negatives ready)\n- Plan and numbers: docs/superpowers/plans/2026-11-25-lateon-deep-full-context.md, exploration/reranker_dev/data/deep_answered_summary.json"
   }
  },
